flowchart TB
  GRADLE[Gradle Build]

  GRADLE --> DSL[DSL Options]
  DSL --> GROOVY[Groovy DSL / build.gradle]
  DSL --> KOTLIN[Kotlin DSL / build.gradle.kts]

  GRADLE --> LC[Lifecycle Phases]
  LC --> INIT[Initialization]
  LC --> CFG[Configuration]
  LC --> EXEC[Execution]

  GRADLE --> TASKS[Tasks]
  TASKS --> BUILTIN[Built-in Types]
  BUILTIN --> COPY[Copy]
  BUILTIN --> EXEC[Exec]
  BUILTIN --> JAR[Jar]
  BUILTIN --> ZIP[Zip]
  BUILTIN --> DELETE[Delete]
  BUILTIN --> JE[JavaExec]
  TASKS --> CUSTOM[Custom Tasks]
  CUSTOM --> TA[TaskAction]
  CUSTOM --> INPUT[Input]
  CUSTOM --> OUTPUT[Output]
  CUSTOM --> CACHE[CacheableTask]

  GRADLE --> PLUGINS[Plugins]
  PLUGINS --> JAVA[java / java-library]
  PLUGINS --> SPRING[spring-boot]
  PLUGINS --> DM[dep management]
  PLUGINS --> MP[maven-publish]
  PLUGINS --> QC[checkstyle / jacoco / spotbugs]

  GRADLE --> DEPS[Dependencies]
  DEPS --> CONFIG[Configurations]
  CONFIG --> IMPL[implementation]
  CONFIG --> API[api]
  CONFIG --> CO[compileOnly]
  CONFIG --> RO[runtimeOnly]
  CONFIG --> TI[testImplementation]
  DEPS --> CATALOG[Version Catalogs]
  CATALOG --> LIB[libs.versions.toml]
  DEPS --> CONSTRAINTS[Constraints]

  GRADLE --> MULTI[Multi-Project]
  MULTI --> SETTINGS[settings.gradle.kts]
  MULTI --> SUB[subprojects]
  MULTI --> ALL[allprojects]
  MULTI --> COMPOSITE[Composite Builds]

  GRADLE --> PERF[Performance]
  PERF --> DAEMON[Daemon Tuning]
  PERF --> CAC[Build Cache]
  PERF --> CC[Configuration Cache]
  PERF --> PAR[Parallel Execution]
  PERF --> CA[Config Avoidance]
